<title>NORWAY: Norway c.bank raises 97 GDP forecast, CPI unchanged.</title>
<headline>Norway c.bank raises 97 GDP forecast, CPI unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's central bank made the following quarterly forecasts for key economic indicator growth in percentage. The bank's third-quarter forecasts in September are included for comparison:</p>
<p>					1996		 1997</p>
<p>				  Dec     Sept	Dec     Sept</p>
<p> Private consumption	4.5    4.25	 3.5     2.75</p>
<p> Public consumption	 2.0    1.75	 1.0     1.0</p>
<p> Export			 9.5    8.25	 6.0     5.0</p>
<p> Import			 3.5    4.0	  6.5     3.75</p>
<p> Overall GDP		  5.5    5.0	  3.5     3.0</p>
<p> Mainland GDP		 3.5    3.25	 3.0     2.5</p>
<p> CPI			    1.25   1.25	 2.5     2.5</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
